<title>USA: R.B. Barry gets global Wal-Mart deal.</title>
<headline>R.B. Barry gets global Wal-Mart deal.</headline>
<dateline>PICKERINGTON, Ohio 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>R.G. Barry Corp said Wednesday it has been selected by Wal-Mart Stores Inc to be a global supplier of home footwear for Wal-Mart International.</p>
<p>&quot;This is an exciting growth opportunity for us, as we expect to gain entrance into new markets for our E-Z Feet comfort footwear line,&quot; said Gordon Zacks, chairman and chief executive officer of R.G. Barry.</p>
<p>Wal-Mart International currently operates retail stores in Canada, Mexico, Brazil, Argentina, Indonesia and China.</p>
</text>
